<http://digistrucmed.org/normative-assertion/lu_3756890c1e5fc6e4f303d0d69c5e6674192365d99b5559676ac7dc7c72e24ed8_n0022/na_0005> <http://digistrucmed.org/operation> "OTHER_OPERATION" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_3756890c1e5fc6e4f303d0d69c5e6674192365d99b5559676ac7dc7c72e24ed8_n0022/tu_0007> <http://digistrucmed.org/verbatimText> "In patients with or without concomitant coronary artery disease (including a prior MI > 1 month ago): a) Prophylactic ICD placement should be considered (LVEF ≤30%) and may be considered (LVEF 31–35%) for those with mild to moderate HF symptoms (NYHA II-III). (Strength of Evidence = A) See Recommendation 9.1 for additional criteria. b) Concomitant ICD placement should be considered in patients undergoing implantation of a biventricular pacing device according to the criteria in Recommendations 9.7–9.8. (Strength of Evidence = B) See Recommendation 9.1 for additional criteria." .
